    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on wolfram2002-ch11-07: resolvable-now, resolvability 0.88";
    dc:description "Classical equivalence constructions among universal models settle the listed formal systems. The practical-computer phrase is also checkable in principle because finite digital hardware can be represented by circuits and memory.";
