    dc:type "resolution-route/proof";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: For each listed formalism, verify a computable encoding into a universal cellular automaton and prove step or output equivalence. Standard computer architectures are covered by encoding finite logic, memory, and control into the universal simulation.";
